 "insight": [
  "In 2008, Luxembourg's imports of computers totaled 4.29 billion euros.",
  "China was the largest supplier, providing 3.99 billion euros or 93.0% of these imports.",
  "Belgium and the United States were the second and third largest suppliers, with 81.2 million euros and 66.1 million euros respectively, together making up 96.4% of the top three imports.",
  "The remaining imports came from the Netherlands, Germany, other countries, and confidential sources in smaller amounts.",
  "These values are nominal and not adjusted for price changes, which is a limitation to consider when interpreting the data."
 ],
